/-!
# The concrete Janko J₃ model

The public carrier `Sporadic.Janko3.Model` is generated by the ATLAS
permutations on 6156 letters. `Model.Basic` proves finiteness, supplies the
faithful permutation embedding and the generating pair, and proves that the
pair does not commute. `Model.Relations` certifies the element orders 2, 3 and
19; `Model.Perfect` proves perfectness. Certification of the group order and
simplicity remains separate; neither assertion enters the definition.

Source: R. A. Wilson et al., ATLAS of Finite Group Representations,
https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/v3/permrep/J3G1-p6156B0 .
-/
